{"Weak postMessage origin check allows bypass - origin validation uses discourseUrl.indexOf(e.origin) === -1 which allows bypass when attacker controls a domain that is a prefix of the legitimate domain": 0.8622840642929077, "RSS feed polling crashes on items without content - code calls i.content.scrub assuming every RSS item has a content field, but many feeds use description instead or have neither field, causing NoMethodError when i.content is nil": 0.9794337153434753, "Unused feed_key method is dead code - method is defined but never called anywhere in the codebase, appears to be leftover code for caching feed modification timestamps": 0.22612108290195465, "RSS items without title crash topic creation - i.title is passed directly to TopicEmbed.import without checking if it's nil, and RSS/ATOM feeds can have items without titles": 0.850412130355835, "Missing nil check crashes on deleted embedded post - when updating an existing embed, embed.post is assigned without checking if the post still exists, causing NoMethodError when trying to revise a nil post": 0.9487641453742981}